				5
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Add agent plugins home and chat language models sandbox config, fix extension cache URI normalisation\n\nAdvance 5 Land/Element submodules with a coordinated update spanning a new sandbox resource, an extension cache resolution fix, and style normalisation across config and build output.\n\n**Sandbox configuration (Wind):**\n- Add `languageModelsResource` (`/User/chatLanguageModels.json`) and `agentPluginsHome` (`/User/agent-plugins`) to `ResolveConfiguration` using the `vscode-userdata` scheme, following the existing `mcpResource` pattern for both the empty and full config presets.\n\n**Extension cache fix (Mountain):**\n- Fix `LoadFromCache` serialising `ExtensionLocation` as the Identifier wrapper shape `{\"value\": url}` instead of a plain `Value::String` URI, which caused the `Normalize.rs` URI parser to fall through to `/extensions/unknown`. The source now emits `Value::String(LocationUri)`; a backward-compatibility branch in `Normalize.rs` unwraps legacy `{\"value\": url_string}` entries so previously-cached manifests still resolve correctly.\n\n**Style normalisation (Cocoon, Output, Worker, Wind, Mountain):**\n- Cocoon: Convert config JS from tabs to 2-space, strip trailing commas, normalise import ordering and export blocks, consolidate duplicate imports in Target.js.\n- Output: Hoist `__defProp`/`__name` shims before imports (reverting imports-first ordering), convert compiled artifacts to 2-space indent, collapse multi-line expressions, strip trailing commas.\n- Worker: Revert ESBuild config from tabs to 2-space, collapse `__name`/`On` declarations to single lines, multi-line exports.\n- Wind: Revert ESBuild config to 2-space, reorganise imports (external before local), multi-line export blocks.\n- Mountain: Alphabetically reorder Sky resource globs in `tauri.conf.json`.\n\nNo runtime behaviour regressions — all formatting passes produce semantically identical build output.",
